##   $isHeldMode - Boolean indicating "held" mode
##   $isResetMode - Boolean indicating "reset" mode
##   $enableBlock - Internal Enable block reference
##   $triggerBlock - Internal Trigger block reference
##   $subsystem - Subsystem reference
##
## Execution Logic:
## 1. Check enable signal (> 0 means enabled)
